 - Make ``logger.catch()`` compatible with asynchronous generators (`#1302 <https://github.com/Delgan/loguru/issues/1302>`_).
+- Improve error message reported when a format string references a non-existent log record key, notably by listing the available keys and by suggesting the use of ``logger.bind()`` with ``{extra[key]}``.
 
